1. The reference of Defold

The files under internal/engine/reference and internal/docs/bundled hold what
the Defold Foundation publishes with each release of Defold at d.defold.com:
its reference documentation, the schema of its project settings, and from its
builtins the names found in the builtin materials and the builtin input
binding. The programs built from this
repository carry those files inside them, and write and serve documentation
made from them.

